      "detail": "Form 10 p39/p40 print Light AA (1)4 Vickers 40mm, 8 25mm, 8 13.2mm, 2.2; Emperor's Fleet p8 prints (2)2 25mm, (4)2 13.2mm, 1.0. Form 10 is retained. The two Kongo cards now keep their own main-gun marks: Hiei p39 Vickers Pattern 'A' 14in/45, Kirishima p40 41st Yr Type 36cm/45; the shell rows are identical."
    },
    {
